      Set, (#ShelfWidth>#ShelfLength1BB)&(#ShelfWidth<=#ShelfLength2BB) & (#ShelfDepth>#ShelfDepthA)&(#ShelfDepth<=#ShelfDepthB): #CostOfHorizontal = #ShelfCost2BB , Set the Cost of This Shelf
