      Set, (#ShelfWidth>#ShelfLength1CB)&(#ShelfWidth<=#ShelfLength2CB) & (#ShelfDepth>#ShelfDepthB)&(#ShelfDepth<=#ShelfDepthC): #CostOfHorizontal = #ShelfCost2CB , Set the Cost of This Shelf
